          "title": "Four Corners",
          "subtitle": "Patience",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Four Corners is a two-deck patience also known as Les Quatre Coins, Cornerstones, or Corner Patience."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Four Corners is named for the four cards or piles placed at the corners of its tableau. The common two-deck version is a traditional foundation-building patience."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
